{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Project Owner Agent Runner Mount Configuration Reads",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "description": "Current Human Project Owner Read, no administrator bypass and no Agent ID prerequisite for candidates. Safe metadata only; offline/incompatible remain durable configuration choices. Two-second original call/I/O deadline, GET/HEAD no body, no-store. Candidate pages limit 1..50/default50 in ID ASC order with Owner/Project/resource/sort-bound signed cursor, current authorization on every page. Mount bindings are a complete same-Tx current Agent/head/refs/definition projection; missing or conflicting mappings fail without partial items. Match agent_version to GetAgentConfig before editing. No root_path, secrets, credentials, hello, physical ensure or execution authority."
  },
